{"id":"29bf786772c49a4b","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-stone-dual.md","title":"Stone Dual Construction","display":"df-stone-dual — Stone Dual Construction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-stone-dual","aliases":["93-df-stone-dual"],"display":"df-stone-dual — Stone Dual Construction","depends_on":["[[93-df-boolalg]]","[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","[[93-df-ultrafilter]]","[[93-df-stone-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-stone-dual"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-stone-dual</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stone-dual — Stone Dual Construction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"757a95a2c335d9fb\" href=\"?note=757a95a2c335d9fb\" title=\"93-df-boolalg\">93-df-boolalg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7087f500cc845c3b\" href=\"?note=7087f500cc845c3b\" title=\"93-df-boolean-algebra\">93-df-boolean-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc989d8f8938c283\" href=\"?note=fc989d8f8938c283\" title=\"93-df-ultrafilter\">93-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a8e20998fad98e\" href=\"?note=d9a8e20998fad98e\" title=\"93-df-stone-space\">93-df-stone-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B\">\\(\\mathbf B\\)</span> is a Boolean-algebra candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(S_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Clopen}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Clopen}_{93}\\)</span> have the signatures fixed in their source definitions.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\mathbf B}\">\\(X_{\\mathbf B}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat b^{\\mathbf B}\">\\(\\widehat b^{\\mathbf B}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B}\">\\(\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Clop}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Clop}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClopMeet}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ClopMeet}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClopJoin}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ClopJoin}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClopNeg}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ClopNeg}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClopZero}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ClopZero}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClopOne}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ClopOne}_{93}\\)</span>, their family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClopOpFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ClopOpFam}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClopAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClopAlg}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_{\\mathbf B}\">\\(\\eta_{\\mathbf B}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\nX_{\\mathbf B}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq|\\mathbf B|:\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(U,\\mathbf B)\\},\n\\qquad\\widehat b^{\\mathbf B}\\coloneqq\\{U\\in X_{\\mathbf B}:b\\in U\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\nX_{\\mathbf B}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq|\\mathbf B|:\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(U,\\mathbf B)\\},\n\\qquad\\widehat b^{\\mathbf B}\\coloneqq\\{U\\in X_{\\mathbf B}:b\\in U\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X_{\\mathbf B}):{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,X_{\\mathbf B})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall b\\in|\\mathbf B|\\;\\bigl(\\widehat b^{\\mathbf B}\\in\\mathcal T\n\\land X_{\\mathbf B}\\setminus\\widehat b^{\\mathbf B}\\in\\mathcal T\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X_{\\mathbf B}):{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,X_{\\mathbf B})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall b\\in|\\mathbf B|\\;\\bigl(\\widehat b^{\\mathbf B}\\in\\mathcal T\n\\land X_{\\mathbf B}\\setminus\\widehat b^{\\mathbf B}\\in\\mathcal T\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Clop}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{C\\subseteq X:\\mathrm{Clopen}_{93}(C;X,\\mathcal T)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ClopMeet}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle C,D\\rangle,C\\cap D\\rangle:\nC,D\\in\\operatorname{Clop}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ClopJoin}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle C,D\\rangle,C\\cup D\\rangle:\nC,D\\in\\operatorname{Clop}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Clop}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{C\\subseteq X:\\mathrm{Clopen}_{93}(C;X,\\mathcal T)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ClopMeet}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle C,D\\rangle,C\\cap D\\rangle:\nC,D\\in\\operatorname{Clop}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ClopJoin}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle C,D\\rangle,C\\cup D\\rangle:\nC,D\\in\\operatorname{Clop}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ClopNeg}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle C,X\\setminus C\\rangle:C\\in\\operatorname{Clop}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ClopNeg}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle C,X\\setminus C\\rangle:C\\in\\operatorname{Clop}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ClopZero}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ClopOne}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\varnothing,X\\rangle\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ClopZero}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ClopOne}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\varnothing,X\\rangle\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ClopOpFam}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle\\wedge,\\operatorname{ClopMeet}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\vee,\\operatorname{ClopJoin}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\neg,\\operatorname{ClopNeg}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\rangle,\n\\langle0,\\operatorname{ClopZero}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\rangle,\n\\langle1,\\operatorname{ClopOne}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\rangle\n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ClopOpFam}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle\\wedge,\\operatorname{ClopMeet}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\vee,\\operatorname{ClopJoin}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\neg,\\operatorname{ClopNeg}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\rangle,\n\\langle0,\\operatorname{ClopZero}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\rangle,\n\\langle1,\\operatorname{ClopOne}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\rangle\n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClopAlg}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\\operatorname{Clop}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T),\n\\operatorname{ClopOpFam}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\right\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClopAlg}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\\operatorname{Clop}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T),\n\\operatorname{ClopOpFam}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T)\\right\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\eta_{\\mathbf B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle b,\\widehat b^{\\mathbf B}\\rangle:b\\in|\\mathbf B|\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\eta_{\\mathbf B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle b,\\widehat b^{\\mathbf B}\\rangle:b\\in|\\mathbf B|\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,X)\\to\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathrm{ClopAlg}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,X)\\to\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathrm{ClopAlg}_{93}(X,\\mathcal T))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\to\n\\eta_{\\mathbf B}:|\\mathbf B|\\to\n\\operatorname{Clop}_{93}(X_{\\mathbf B},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\to\n\\eta_{\\mathbf B}:|\\mathbf B|\\to\n\\operatorname{Clop}_{93}(X_{\\mathbf B},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B}\">\\(\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B}\\)</span> is the least topology containing the canonical basic sets and their complements. The representing object has explicit binary, unary, and nullary operation graphs, and the canonical map is itself a graph landing in the exact carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","